# Deployment artifacts for Streamlit Community Cloud: it only clones the repo
# and pip-installs requirements.txt, with no build-time training step, so the
# app needs these pre-generated (deterministic/seeded, regenerable via
# data/scripts/generate_shipments.py + src/baseline/train.py + src/deep/train_tft.py).
!data/raw/delay_timeseries.csv
!data/raw/baseline_predictions.csv
!data/raw/tft_predictions.csv

